 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No motif on the angels (18:8) or on 18:11-12 (an attribute): geometric for the testimony, wind for the scattering into sects. STAGING v4: 17: the God-fearing in a prayer hall in the last part of the night (As-Sa'di: they prolonged the prayer to the pre-dawn, then sat asking forgiveness): they pray, a man gives to a poor man (spending on the needy), then they sit and raise their hands on 17:5-6; stars plate on 17:6. 18: Allah's testimony stays on the geometric plate (ended at 19:1); the angels are not drawn; the people of knowledge testify (speak on 18:9) and read on 18:13; no gesture on 18:11-12 (His attribute). 19: two groups of the People of the Book appear (Al-Muyassar: they split into sects), argue, read their Book, then turn away from each other on 19:17-18; no gesture on the conditional 19:19-22; hourglass plate for the reckoning."
 },
